Short:    Tempest to FAME UserData-converter (v1.00)
Uploader: zod@trsi.de (Michael 'Zod/Trsi' A.)
Author:   zod@trsi.de (Michael 'Zod/Trsi' A.)
Type:     comm/bbs

--- 02-11-97 --- An after-halloween tRSi production in 1997 ---

T2F - Tempest to FAME BBS User Data converter. This tool does convert
everything important ( i guess ) from Tempest to FAME,

It also defaults all other FAME user data elements to the original
FAME default values.

If you need more to be converted just enhance the T2F.c source code!

For more informations how to use T2F etc. just start T2F in a shell
and read the instructions.

tRSi-T2F.lha contends:

 - make               9 bytes
 - SCOPTIONS        147 bytes
 - T2F            6.728 bytes
 - T2F.c         20.813 bytes
 - T2F.readme       850 bytes


PS: Thanx to chels for some "real" tempest userdata :).

